  "submissionReconciliation": "EAS terminal ERRORED has no exposed error details or log files. Independent Apple VALID/APPROVED and both existing groups IN_BETA_TESTING establish TestFlight availability; no repeat upload. Root cause of EAS status is unverified.",
  "testerNotes": "Stackr 1.0.4 (49)\n\nThis update addresses feedback on build 48. It restores the original startup artwork, removes unnecessary startup waiting, shows useful search matches sooner, and adds retry options when discovery or pricing requests fail. Card inspection opens with one long press, with improved image corners. Search and binder scrolling preload visible thumbnails and a small nearby window. Inspection adds a darker shadow, directional simulated foil lighting on verified holo finishes, and one firmer opening haptic. Your motion and haptic settings remain respected.\n\nPlease check Mew search, Japanese and Chinese set browsing, Morpeko and Froakie inspection, image corners, motion and haptic preferences, and Home/binder/card values for the same holdings. Reduce Motion stays still while its setting is loading.\n\nArtwork recovery continues through the API. The SV4a 40-card gap, missing English/descriptive metadata, provider freshness and unpriced holdings remain separate work. Catalogue-wide price preloading is not active; cards without stored quotes will show unavailable, and stored estimates may be labelled stale. This build does not claim complete card data, prices, exact foil masks or universal sub-0.5-second loading.\n\nPlease report your phone model, iOS version, build 49 and the card/set or action tested. Phone testing remains pending.",
